meta {
  name: 02 Auth
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Account endpoints (EP-01 to EP-09). Logs in as the seeded buyer and keeps its tokens for later folders.

  Register, login, forgot-password and reset-password share a limit of 10 requests per minute per IP, and a full run uses six of them: wait a minute between runs or the second run gets 429.
}
